Subject: [PATCH] event-log: load all pages before publishing the collection

Follow Members@odata.nextLink so records after the first 1000 entries are
available to the event page, health summary and export. Keep the previous
complete list if any page fails, deduplicate boundary entries and reject
pagination loops. A newer load invalidates older in-flight traversals.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD event log integration]

